  "bodyHash": "NELKVXHLcH0=",
  "content": "<p><span><span><strong>本模组添加了大量不相关的物品、工具、机器、附魔以及少量药水效果。<br></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>为学习模组，我们建议安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>模组，并查看循环指南书物品（1.16+版本）。</strong></span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><strong>对于1.12版本，有一本使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guide-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guide API</a>编写的类似指南书。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>整合包开发者可在此查看示例配置和脚本：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里&nbsp;</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>必要依赖</h3><p>在Minecraft 1.20及更新版本中，Cyclic现在依赖此库模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib\" rel=\"nofollow\">FLIB</a>以及许多其他模组（旧版Minecraft仍无依赖项，且该库不会向后移植）。</p><h2>可选依赖</h2><p>Cyclic不要求必须安装以下模组，但如果安装，Cyclic内置的功能会得到增强。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>旧版本请点击文件，然后选择网站上的“查看全部”，并使用下拉筛选菜单。以下是一些快捷方式：</p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:6170\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.10.2</a></span></p><p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2</a></strong> </span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.16.5</strong></a> </span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.18.2</strong></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9366\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.19.2</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.12/scripts_zen_example\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.12 Crafttweaker 示例</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><strong>配置文件：请查看 /mods/ 文件夹旁 /config/ 文件夹中生成的配置文件。同时请通过问题链接访问 Github 网站查看示例配置文件。所有版本的模组都有一个或多个配置文件。<br></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>例如，1.16.5 等新版本有一个 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic.toml</a> 文件和一个 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic-client.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic-client.toml</a> 文件。</strong></span></p><p><span><strong>而 1.12.2 也有两个配置文件：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.12/cyclicmagic.cfg\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclicmagic.cfg</a> 和 cyclic_ores.cfg。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>技术说明 - 使用的第三方工具</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>音效使用 BFXR 制作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.bfxr.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.bfxr.net/</a></p>\n<p>部分模型借助 Crayfish Model Creator 制作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmrcrayfish.com%252ftools%253fid%253dmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mrcrayfish.com/tools?id=mc</a></p>\n<p>编码使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge API</a>，使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.eclipse.org%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eclipse</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgradle.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gradle</a><br>纹理使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.getpaint.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paint.net</a> 创建</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;开源致谢！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>秉承开源精神，感谢在 Cyclic 中使用了少量代码的其他模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Botania - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b75dedf899a086414b16cb8ce3bcc62cc5b4c9d/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/Vector3.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vector3 类&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li>Not Enough Wands - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L252\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenGL 渲染功能&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li>Builders Guides - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L324\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open GL 渲染功能</a></li>\n<li>Random Things - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b61a4d1dd6b8d5732f69674b62282068ca3be19/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/component/miner/TileEntityBlockMiner.java#L28\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用假玩家从方块实体影响世界</a></li>\n<li>Baubles - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilPlayerInventoryFilestorage.java#L17\" rel=\"nofollow\">在二进制文件中保存玩家的物品栏</a></li>\n<li>Vanilla Automation - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/proxy/ClientProxy.java#L267\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用 PlayerControllerMP 改变玩家触及距离</a></li>\n<li>Sponge -<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/issues/143\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 他们在网络数据包、多线程、并发异常和计划服务器任务方面提供了帮助</a></li>\n<li>Ellpeck (AA) 提供了一些<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/db9728eeb846c5a5dfa495c792895fc64fb961a3/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/block/base/TileEntityBaseMachineInvo.java#L144\" rel=\"nofollow\">精美的能量传输代码</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;教程/指南/参考致谢！</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbedrockminer.jimdo.com%252fmodding-tutorials%252fbasic-modding-1-7%252fcustom-tools-swords%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">工具</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fExperience%2523Leveling_up\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家经验</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%252ftopic%252c7146.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">查找现有配方</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.com.au%252f2015%252f01%252ftileentity.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块实体</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodwiki.temporal-reality.com%252fmw%252findex.php%252fRender_Block_TESR_%252f_OBJ-1.9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TESR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/modification-development/1432714-forge-using-addinformation-on-a-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemBlock 元数据</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fwiki%252fContainers_and_GUIs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f28330-solvedtileentity-implementing-iupdateplayerlistbox-only-working-clientside%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级方块实体</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31953.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d30567.\" rel=\"nofollow\">粒子效果</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d29544.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块状态变化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d25937.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块旋转</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d39162.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客户端服务器同步</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38710.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d15351.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fjabelarminecraft.blogspot.ca%252fp%252fminecraft-forge-creating-custom.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">成就</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.ca%252f2014%252f12%252ftransparent-blocks-18.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块透明</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d22378.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI 文本输入</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31853.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客户端代理提示</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38076.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义音效</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d37547.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/mapping-and-modding-tutorials/1571434-tutorial-modding-with-apis\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用模组 API，如 JEI 或 Baubles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d27684.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">代理渲染</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d11024.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">药水效果</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d12358.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">药水纹理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d24403.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">圆形和球形</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f37202-19-playerinteractevent-for-right-click-no-longer-works%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家事件</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31966.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d43152.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体伤害</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f29593-18-solveddisplay-gui-when-interacting-with-an-entity%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民 GUI</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>音效归属</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>门铃声效致谢：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoundbible.com%252f1599-Store-Door-Chime.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://soundbible.com/1599-Store-Door-Chime.html</a><br>&nbsp;许可证：署名 3.0 <br>&nbsp;由 Mike Koenig 录制</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有其他<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献者</a>和翻译者</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>经典整合包：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/247972-we-gonna-die\" rel=\"nofollow\">We Gonna Die</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/251861-ftb-presents-hermitpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB HermitPack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/247107-beyond-vanilla-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beyond-Vanilla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/229466-material-energy-ex-1-10-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Material Energy^Ex</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/233380-shadowlands-basic-mods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadowlands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/246156-technologyadvanced\" rel=\"nofollow\">Technology Advanced</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/252320-overpowered-non-content\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overpowered Non-Content</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/252898-hyperantix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hyper Antix</a></li>\n<li>Nameless Pack (JonBams)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-modded-way-pixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Modded Way Pixelmon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/255419-couplecraft-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoupleCraft 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/254202-farming-valley\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farming Valley</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/243934-the-new-frontier\" rel=\"nofollow\">The New Frontier</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/256546-we-gonna-die-again\" rel=\"nofollow\">We Gonna Die Again</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/all-the-mods-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">All The Mods 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.atlauncher.com%252fpack%252fMechMagic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mech &amp; Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hypothermia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hypothermia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/skills-not-included-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skills Not Included</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/enigmatica2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enigmatica 2</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>请将所有请求、漏洞、报告和崩溃日志提交到 GitHub Issues 页面</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
